╭─ Context Retrieval Agent (Model response (context analysis)) ──────╮
│ To resolve the issue described, we need to address the fact that   │
│ the __deepcopy__ method in Django's FormField does not copy the    │
│ error_messages dictionary when deep-copied. This leads to shared   │
│ state between form fields, which is problematic in scenarios where │
│ form instances are modified dynamically.                           │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│             ✅ Key Observations from the Code Context              │
│                                                                    │
│                 1. Class and Method Identification                 │
│                                                                    │
│  • Class: Field (base class for form fields)                       │
│  • Method: __deepcopy__ (special method for deep copying)          │
│  • File: django/forms/fields.py                                    │
│                                                                    │
│                  2. Code Behavior of __deepcopy__                  │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  def __deepcopy__(self, memo):                                     │
│      result = copy.copy(self)                                      │
│      memo[id(self)] = result                                       │
│      result.widget = copy.deepcopy(self.widget, memo)              │
│      result.validators = self.validators[:]                        │
│      return result                                                 │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  • This method:                                                    │
│     • Creates a shallow copy of the instance (copy.copy(self))     │
│     • Copies the widget and validators attributes                  │
│     • Does not copy the error_messages dictionary                  │
│                                                                    │
│                          3. Issue Summary                          │
│                                                                    │
│  • The error_messages dictionary is not included in the deep copy. │
│  • As a result, all form fields (e.g., ProfileForm) share the same │
│    error_messages dictionary.                                      │
│  • This causes incorrect error behavior when form fields           │
